# Interface Vision (Minimalist UI Theme)

Sidequest Mail should feel like a clean editor — but work like Proton Mail.
The whitespace is the skin, not the mechanics.
Everything below is aesthetic and optional; the core email flow (read, reply, file, delete) must always be instant.

---

## Layout Grid

| Screen       | Minimalist Concept   | Behavior                                                                 |
|:-------------|:---------------------|:-------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| **Inbox**    | The File Tree        | Emails are listed as files. Unread files are bold.                       |
|              |                      | Opening one "opens" the file — the boldness fades.                       |
| **Folders**  | The Project          | Each folder is a project. Navigating there shows: *"Project Opened."*    |
| **Sent**     | The Commit           | You sent it. "Commit Pushed" energy.                                     |
| **Trash**    | The Recycle Bin      | Where files get deleted. Dragging an email there deletes it.             |
|              |                      | Restoring it is "Undo Delete."                                           |
| **Drafts**   | The Sandbox          | Still being written. No syntax highlighting yet.                         |

---

## Navigation Grid

| Key          | Action               | Flavor Text                              |
|:-------------|:---------------------|:-----------------------------------------|
| **Arrow Keys** | Move focus between emails | No sound (silent mode default)   |
| **Spacebar**   | Open selected email    | *"Open File"*                          |
| **Enter**      | Reply while reading    | *"New Draft"*                          |
| **Drag & Drop** | Move between folders   | File move animation                    |

---

## Visual Design Grid

| Element        | Concept          | Description                                                                 |
|:---------------|:-----------------|:----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| **Sidebar**    | The Explorer     | Clean, gray background. Fonts are clean sans-serif (Inter, Roboto).          |
| **Email Cards** | File Items     | Each email is a clean row with sender's name and subject. Unread rows are bold. |
| **Compose**    | The Editor       | A clean, white canvas. Subject line = Title.                                 |
| **Stickers**   | None             | Minimalist theme has no stickers. Or, tiny, flat icons.                      |

---

## Micro-interactions Grid

| Action         | Sound / Effect   | Trigger Context                          |
|:---------------|:-----------------|:-----------------------------------------|
| Reading        | None             | Silent                                   |
| Replying       | None             | Silent                                   |
| Deleting       | None             | Silent                                   |
| Searching      | None             | Silent                                   |
| Composing      | None             | Silent                                   |
| Loading        | Progress bar     | Thin, minimal line                       |

> All sounds default to **off**.
> Silent mode is the default for a reason: this is still an email client people use at work.

